        "Aadhaamuku avvanu ardhaangigaa ichchi",
        "Saati ayina sahaayamu kaavaalani Devudu",
        "Purushuniki sthreeni ichchi 1 ga jatha parichaadu",
        "Aadajanma avasarathanu andharikee thelipaadu"
