        "Devuni daya dwaarane pillalu pudithe",
        "Garbhamlone champesthunnaaru",
        "Puttina vaarandharoo purushulu ayithe",
        "Purushulaki lokamlo sthreele karuvavuthaaru",
        "Aada janmaku brathike arhathane undadu",
        "Aadavaarini brathikinchi kaapaadandi",
